flowchart TD
  A[Gateway receives request] --> B[Resolve service-specific budget]
  B --> C[Acquire bounded concurrency slot]
  C --> D{Slot available?}
  D -->|No| E[Reject or bounded queue]
  D -->|Yes| F[Call approved upstream with deadline]
  F --> G{Upstream responds?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Normalize response]
  G -->|No| I[Classify timeout or failure]
  I --> J{Retry is safe and budget remains?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Backoff with jitter]
  K --> F
  J -->|No| L[Map safe public error]
  H --> M[Release resources]
  L --> M
